  "explanation": "Three places the record could sit, judged against the two situations that break it: a plan picked up a week later or from the other harness, and a conversation that belongs to no plan at all. [The recommendation](#the-recommendation) is the only one that answers both, and it pays for that with two files and a rule saying which one applies. Leaves out cleanup — none of the three says when a record stops being worth keeping.",
